# 统一换行符为 LF（Linux 风格）：提交与检出均为 LF，杜绝 CRLF 警告
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不参与换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.gz binary
*.xz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.obj binary
*.pdb binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.qm binary

# 下面 3 个 fixture 依赖「磁盘上真实的 CRLF 字节」才有意义（用例名即
# normalize crlf / normalize crlf and bom）。上面的 eol=lf 会在提交时把 CR 抹掉，
# 使新 clone 只剩 LF —— 用例仍绿但覆盖静默失效。故显式标记为不做换行转换。
tests/fixtures/lyrics_srt/crlf.srt      -text
tests/fixtures/lyrics_ass/crlf-bom.ass  -text
tests/fixtures/lyrics_ttml/crlf.ttml    -text
